5. Shader presets
-----------------
shaders/ holds libretro GLSL presets (crt-lottes, crt-hyllian, crt-1tap,
crt-2tap, xBR, ScaleFX) and Lola Retro's arcade-15khz, each under the
permissive licence in its file or folder; see shaders/README.txt.
`make shaders-extra` fetches GPL presets for local use; they are separate
files read at run time.

Release packages additionally carry SDL2 (zlib), Zig (MIT) and TinyCC
(LGPL 2.1, loaded as a separate library); their licences are in the
packages' licenses/ folder.
